OL,3,GNEWSAReserve hails best barn owl
OL,4,Anumbers in 20 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FManagers of a wetland nature reserve
OL,7,Fare celebrating after what they
OL,8,Fdescribe as a "record-breaking" year
OL,9,Ffor barn owl breeding.
OL,11,FSteve Couch, a warden at the RSPB
OL,12,Freserve at Ham Wall in Somerset, said
OL,13,F2026 had been a great season for the
OL,14,Fbirds, with 25 owlets hatched from five
OL,15,Fpairs.
OL,17,FIt comes after the "poorest" season a
OL,18,Fyear earlier, with the RSPB putting the
OL,19,Fsuccess down to maintenance of the
OL,20,Fwetland.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
