OL,3,GNEWSAReserve hails best barn owl
OL,4,Anumbers in 20 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouch said he was "over the moon",
OL,7,Fadding: "They're [barn owls] such an
OL,8,Ficonic species and people really
OL,9,Fdelight in them."
